  "body": "After a long-winded debugging session with Claude, I managed to obtain a local fully functional build. It is more complicated than I imagined. The dependency on Macports is very tight. Plus, the github build overwrites the gtk+3 package in the ports, which is not ideal on a local machine.\n\nIf I'm not mistaken, the binary packages as they are built by the CI lack a few features. One which was important for me is the possibility to export to JXL. So I'm happy that I did it.\n\nI will consider a fork, although I'm not sure I want to commit myself to it...",
